<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette upgraded HBO &amp; Co to outperform from market perform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 2-1/2 to 57-1/4.</p>
